                                "sense_id": "9c4bcfdb-197d-3baa-a4ba-fca90586704b",
                                "text": "The male announcer eventually came back on stage to say that there would be a brief pause as the votes were counted and introduced another display of Mandi Steele video footage with thunderingly loud, dramatic music."
